  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "Two coils require <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math> minutes and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn></math> minutes respectively to produce same amount of heat energy when connected separately to the same source. If they are connected in parallel arrangement to the same source; the time required to produce same amount of heat by the combination of coils, will be _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>min</mi></math>.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "15",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi></math>&nbsp;is the heat required to heat the water, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>H</mi><mn>60</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>H</mi><mn>20</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>When the coils are connected in parallel their powers will get added. If the required time now is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>H</mi><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>H</mi><mn>60</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>H</mi><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
